=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play engine/dns-refused-networkmanager -----------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the real$
# plan/apply engine against a simulated host, hostfake's$
# recording host.System, whose commands a model of the host$
# answers. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and$
# file is the fake's, and its record is shown when play ends.$
$
# Info: engine/dns-refused-networkmanager$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13 with NetworkManager;$
# /etc/resolv.conf links to NetworkManager's file. hardn.yml$
# lists 192.0.2.54, 2001:db8::54.$
# The change: Configure DNS, hardn.yml's nameservers. The plan$
# refuses it, with a report (P-37 (a)).$
$
# Operation Failed$
# NetworkManager manages DNS here (DNS_MANAGED)$
$
  Check the log file at /var/log/hardn.log for details$
  To go on: set the nameservers with nmcli.$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

